 `CustomerRepository` deliberately behaves like a real paged backend: it refuses
 to return more than `MAX_PAGE_SIZE` (200) rows in a single call. Callers page.
+Filtering happens in the repository too, so the grid pages and counts only the
+matching customers.
+
+## Filtering
+
+The view at `/` has a name filter and a status filter. Both are kept in the
+address bar, so a narrowed list can be reopened or shared:
+
+```text
+/?name=vir&status=ACTIVE,CLOSED
